one is an androgen that can accumulate in individuals with aromatase deficiency, contributing to virilization.\",1\r\n5216,ADENOMA BENIGNO,A benign tumor of the adrenal gland that rarely secretes sex hormones.,1\r\n7207,PANCREATECTOMY DUODENAL,Pancreatectomy duodenal is a surgical procedure of choice for tumors located in the head of the pancreas.,1\r\n7208,PANCREATECTOMY DISTAL,Pancreatectomy distal is a surgical procedure performed for tumors located in the body and tail of the pancreas.,1\r\n5201,SECRECIÓN DE HORMONAS SEXUALES,\"The secretion of sex hormones by adrenal tumors is rare, typically associated with malignant conditions.\",1\r\n5217,HIDROXIPROGESTERONA,17-hidroxiprogesterona is a hormone that should be measured in cases of bilateral adrenal incidentalomas to rule out congenital adrenal hyperplasia due to 21-hydroxylase deficiency.,1\r\n\n\n-----Relationships-----\nhuman_readable_id,source,target,description,combined_degree\r\n3379,PACIENTE,TAC,The patient underwent TAC imaging to monitor their condition and detect any lesions,559\r\n3161,PACIENTE,DHEA-S,Los niveles de DHEA-S del paciente se correlacionan con su condición de pubertad precoz,553\r\n1034,HOSPITAL,ADENOCARCINOMA OF PANCREAS,The hospital is where the patient was diagnosed and treated for adenocarcinoma of the pancreas,100\r\n1728,SARCOPENIA,DHEA-S,\"La disminución de DHEA-S se ha asociado con la pérdida de masa muscular, lo que contribuye a la sarcopenia en los ancianos.\",90\r\n13797,AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION,DRALLE H,Dralle H is a co-author of the guidelines published by the American Thyroid Association,60\r\n11984,INCIDENTALOMA SUPRARRENAL,UPTODATE,\"UpToDate provides current literature and guidelines on the management of adrenal incidentalomas, known in Spanish as \"\"incidentaloma suprarrenal.\"\" The platform offers updated information to assist healthcare professionals in effectively managing this condition.\",60\r\n11960,FEOCROMOCITOMA,TAC,A TAC is commonly used to detect feocrom